# Configuration

## Environment

Selected via `--dart-define=ENV=dev|qa|stage|prod` at build time. Default: `dev`.

## Base URLs

| ENV | URL |
|-----|-----|
| dev | `https://dev-api.trysanad.us/api/v1/` |
| qa | `https://qa-api.trysanad.us/api/v1/` |
| stage | `https://stage-api.trysanad.us/api/v1/` |
| prod | `https://api.trysanad.us/api/v1/` |

## Package Ownership

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `packages/config` | Pure Dart — `AppConfig`, `NetworkConfig`, `FeatureFlags` |
| `packages/flavors` | Maps ENV to URLs, Firebase project IDs, feature flag overrides |
| `apps/*/lib/src/config/` | App-level adapter to `packages/config` |

## Rules

- Never hardcode base URLs or API keys — always read from `AppConfig`
- `packages/config` must remain pure Dart (no `flutter` dependency)
- Feature flags: `FeatureFlags` class in `config` package
- Timeouts: 15s default in `NetworkConfig`
- No user-facing config mutation at runtime — all config is build-time
